Package: sovereignops
Type: Package
Title: Domain-Aware Reliability Contracts for Mission-Critical Telemetry
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Rodolfo", "Pereira", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                   comment = c(affiliation = "ShockBridge Pulse Research Lab"))
Description: R interface to the Sovereign Ops decision envelope and abstention
    protocol. Provides typed wrappers around the Python contract system for
    cross-language reproducibility of reliability analysis on spacecraft and
    wind-turbine telemetry. The shared governance layer (contracts, abstention
    vocabulary, evaluation protocol) is domain-agnostic; domain-specific models
    and preprocessing remain in Python.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/rolffcoelho-bravo/sovereign-ops-2.0
BugReports: https://github.com/rolffcoelho-bravo/sovereign-ops-2.0/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
